      "side": 1,
      "message": "we should not be mixing up pre-mp and prod images on the same device. Also, is you have two prod signed images with the same version number programmed in the H1, the B is always guaranteed to run, because they have the same version number and both have header timestamp set to zero.\n\nThat is even if you program .prod on an H1 running .pre-pvt, the .prod is not guaranteed to run if it is of the same version number.",
